# Complex RLC circuit
# Includes DC and analogue AC voltage sources

# =========================
# Voltage sources
# =========================

V1 1 0 VDC 12
V2 8 0 VDC 5
V3 12 0 VDC 3.3

# Analogue sinusoidal sources
# name node1 node2 VAC amplitude frequency phase
Analogue1 16 0 VAC 5 50 0
Analogue2 17 0 VAC 2 100 45
Analogue3 18 0 VAC 1 1000 90

# =========================
# Main input network
# =========================

R1 1 2 R 1k
R2 2 0 R 4.7k
C1 2 0 C 10u

R3 2 3 R 220
L1 3 4 L 10m
C2 4 0 C 4.7u
R4 4 0 R 2.2k

# =========================
# First branch
# =========================

R5 3 5 R 680
C3 5 0 C 1u
R6 5 6 R 330